# Offline-First Field Surveying App with Sync Capability

Below is a comprehensive implementation of an offline-first field surveying app that syncs data when reconnected to the network. This example uses React with TypeScript, but the concepts can be adapted to other frameworks.

## Core Features
- Offline data storage using IndexedDB
- Background sync when connection is restored
- Conflict resolution strategies
- Data validation
- User-friendly UI with offline indicators

