   - Tooltips showing detailed price information on hover

2. **Real-Time Updates**:
   - Configurable update interval (5s to 1m)
   - Mock data generation (replace with real API calls in production)

3. **Zoom/Pan Interactions**:
   - Mouse wheel zoom
   - Click and drag to pan
   - Reset button to return to default view

4. **Customization Options**:
   - Select different stocks (AAPL, MSFT, etc.)
   - Choose different timeframes (1 day to 5 years)
   - Adjust update frequency

5. **Responsive Design**:
   - Works on different screen sizes
   - Mobile-friendly controls

