3. The zoom/pan functionality is implemented using D3's built-in zoom behavior, which provides smooth interactions.

4. The color scale is quantile-based, which means it automatically adjusts to the distribution of your data.

To use this implementation, simply save the HTML and JavaScript files and open the HTML file in a browser. The heatmap will load with default settings and begin updating automatically.

