4. **Limitations**:
   - No user authentication (all users see the same board)
   - Basic UI with no advanced styling
   - No task priorities or labels
   - No comments or attachments

This implementation provides a solid foundation that you can extend with additional features like user authentication, more detailed task properties, or advanced collaboration features.

