# Ultra-Low-Latency Networking Service with Packet-Level Filtering and Forwarding

Below is an initial implementation of a high-performance networking service that focuses on ultra-low latency with packet-level filtering and forwarding capabilities. This implementation uses C++ for performance and includes basic packet processing functionality.

